  "name": "Breaker Core",
  "description": "A Scrap Breaker Core: breaks wrecked parts into material, like a Recycler with a 1.6 m mouth. On its own a 1 t part takes 15 s. Weld Shredder Blocks on its +x side: they split into square shredders (1 x 1 up to 5 x 5), the mouth is the whole bed, and a bigger square shreds more a block (a 2 x 2 makes it x7, its bin 4,200), up to 50 blocks. A chute takes the yield from its Chute out. Needs power: a share for it and each block.",
